    "text": ", िररष्ठ श्रम और रोिगार सलािकार 4 THE GAZETTE OF INDIA : EXTRAORDINARY [PART II—SEC. 3(ii)] MINISTRY OF LABOUR AND EMPLOYMENT NOTIFICATION New Delhi, the 13th May, 2026 S.O. 2503(E).— In exercise of the powers conferred by sub -section (3) of section 111 of the Occupational Safety, Health and Working Conditions Code 2020 (37 of 2020), the Central Government hereby appoints the officers mentioned in column (2) of the table as appellate authority for the purpose of the Code within the local limits of their jurisdiction specified in column (3) of the Table below: TABLE Serial No. Designation of Officer Jurisdiction (Area) (1) (2) (3) 1. Addl. Chief Labour Commissioner (Central), All Deputy Chief Labour Commissioners (Central) Office of the Chief Labour Commissioner (Central), New Delhi The whole of India. 2. All Deputy Chief Labour Commissioner (Central), Ahmedabad region The State of Gujarat and the Union territories of Dadra and Nagar Haveli and Daman and Diu. 3. All Deputy Chief Labour",
