    "text": "SAKHA 24, 1948 सी.जी.-डी.एल.-अ.-19052026-272708 CG-DL-E-19052026-272708 2 THE GAZETTE OF INDIA : EXTRAORDINARY [PART II—SEC. 3(ii)] सारणी क्र.सं. कायायलय अजधकाररता (क्षेत्र) (1) (2) (3) 1. जनिेिक (सुरक्षा), डॉक सुरक्षा प्रभाग, कारखाना सलाि सेिा एिं श्रम संस्ट्थान मिाजनिेिालय, मुंबई। सभी प्रमुख पत्तन। [फा. सं . एस-65025/16/2026-आईएसएच-II] आलोक चंद्र, िररष्ठ श्रम और रोिगार सलािकार MINISTRY OF LABOUR AND EMPLOYMENT NOTIFICATION New Delhi, the 13th May, 2026 S.O. 2491(E).— In exercise of the powers conferred by sub -section (3) of section 111 of the Occupational Safety, Health and Working Conditions Code, 2020 (37 of 2020), the Central Government hereby appoints the gazetted officer of the Government mentioned in column (2) o f the Table below to be the appellate authority for the purpose of the said Code, in case of dock work, within the local limits of the jurisdiction specified in column (3) of the Table below:- TABLE Sl. No. Office Jurisdiction (Area) (1) (2) (3) 1. Director (Safety),",
