    "text": "ं. एस-65025/6/2026-आईएसएच-II] आलोक चंर, िररष्ठ श्रम और रोिगार सलािकार सं. 2397] नई दिल्ली, बृिस्ट् पजतिार, मई 14, 2026/िैिाख 24, 1948 No. 2397] NEW DELHI, THURSDAY, MAY 14, 2026/VAISAKHA 24, 1948 सी.जी.-डी.एल.-अ.-19052026-272710 CG-DL-E-19052026-272710 2 THE GAZETTE OF INDIA : EXTRAORDINARY [PART II—SEC. 3(ii)] MINISTRY OF LABOUR AND EMPLOYMENT NOTIFICATION New Delhi, the 13th May, 2026 S.O. 2489(E).— In exercise of the powers conferred by sub-section (5) of section 34 of the Occupational Safety, Health and Working Conditions Code, 2020 (37 of 2020), the Central Government hereby appoints the officers mentioned in column (2) of the Table below to be the Chief Inspector Cum Facilitator for the purpose of the said Code within the local limits of the jurisdiction specified in column (3) of the Table below: - TABLE Sl. No. Office Jurisdiction (Area) (1) (2) (3) 1. Chief Labour Commissioner (Central), and Additional Chief Labour Commissioner (Central) The whole of India (except mines). [F.",
