    "text": "षक-सि-सुजिधाप्रिाता के रूप में जनयुि करती िै, ििां तक उक् त संजिता का जिस्ट् तार िै। [फा. सं. एस-65025/5/2026-आईएसएच-II] आलोक चंर, िररष्ठ श्रम और रोिगार सलािकार सं. 2392] नई दिल्ली, बुधिार, मई 13, 2026/िैिाख 23, 1948 No. 2392] NEW DELHI, WEDNESDAY, MAY 13, 2026/VAISAKHA 23, 1948 सी.जी.-डी.एल.-अ.-14052026-272574 CG-DL-E-14052026-272574 2 THE GAZETTE OF INDIA : EXTRAORDINARY [PART II—SEC. 3(ii)] MINISTRY OF LABOUR AND EMPLOYMENT NOTIFICATION New Delhi, the 13th May, 2026 S.O. 2484(E).— In exercise of the powers conferred by sub-section (5) of section 34 of the Occupational Safety Health and Working Conditions Code, 2020 (37 of 2020) and in supersession of the notification of Government of India in the Ministry of Labour and Employment N o. 4013(E), dated the 19 th of September 2024, except as respects things done or omitted to done before such supersession, the Central Government hereby appoints, the Director General of Mines Safety in the Directorate General of Mines Safety, Dhanbad, to",
