    "text": "बाि, बुलन्िििर, बरेली, मुिफ्फरनगर, मुरािाबाि, 4 THE GAZETTE OF INDIA : EXTRAORDINARY [PART II—SEC. 3(ii)] ज्योजतबाफ ु ले नगर, अमरोिा, पीलीभीत , िािििााँपुर, बिायूाँ, रामपुर, बागपत, िापुड, िामली और गौतमबुद्धनगर जिले और उपरोि जिलों में से बनाया गया कोई नया जिला। [फा. सं. एस-65025/9/2026-आईएसएच-।।] आलोक चंद्र, िररष्ठ श्रम और रोिगार सलािकार MINISTRY OF LABOUR AND EMPLOYMENT NOTIFICATION New Delhi, the 13th May, 2026 S.O. 2513(E).— In exercise of the powers conferred by sub-section (1) of section 34 of the Occupational Safety, Health and Working Conditions Code, 2020 (37 of 2020), the Central Government hereby appoints the officers mentioned in column (2) of the table to be as the Inspector-cum-facilitator for the purpose of the Code within the local limits of their jurisdiction as specified in column (3) of the Table below:- TABLE Sl. No. Designation of Officers Jurisdiction (Area) (1) (2) (3) 1. All Assistant Labour Commissioners (Central), All Labour Enforcement Officers (Central), Poste",
