    "text": "to such establishment in FORM-XVII related to category of employees, health and welfare facilities, retrenchment or layoffs, bonus, maternity benefits etc. to the Inspector -cum-Facilitator having jurisdiction so as to reach on or before the last day of February following the end of each Calendar year electronically. 75. Register of accident and dangerous occurrences.- The registers of accident and dangerous occurrences required by sub-clause (v) of clause (a) of section 33 of the Code shall be maintained in FORM-XIX. 76. Register of leave with wages.- (1) The employer of every establishment shall maintain in respect of every employee thereof a record of leave with wages electronically or otherwise in FORM-XX and shall share the leave records of the respective employee, once in a Calendar year, on demand. (2) The register mentioned in sub-rule (1) shall be preserved for a period of five years after the last entry in them has been made and shall not be destroyed even after the expiry of",
