    "text": "सं. 2391] नई दिल्ली, बुधिार, मई 13, 2026/िैिाख 23, 1948 No. 2391] NEW DELHI, WEDNESDAY, MAY 13, 2026/VAISAKHA 23, 1948 सी.जी.-डी.एल.-अ.-14052026-272575 CG-DL-E-14052026-272575 2 THE GAZETTE OF INDIA : EXTRAORDINARY [PART II—SEC. 3(ii)] MINISTRY OF LABOUR AND EMPLOYMENT NOTIFICATION New Delhi, the 13th May, 2026 S.O. 24 83(E).— In exercise of the powers conferred under clause (a) of sub -section (2) of section 57 of the Occupational Safety, Health and Working Conditions Code, 2020 (37 of 2020), the Central Government hereby appoints designated authority comprising of the following, namely: - (1) Director General, Directorate General of Labour Welfare-Chairperson; (2) Representative of Chief Labour Commissioner (Central)-Member; (3) Representative of Directorate General of Mines Safety- Member; (4) Representative of Directorate General Factory Advice Service and Labour Institutes. [F. No. S-65025/25/2026-ISH-II] ALOK CHANDRA, Senior Labour And Employment Advisor Uploaded by Dte. of Print",
