    "text": "24, 1948 सी.जी.-डी.एल.-अ.-14052026-272569 CG-DL-E-14052026-272569 2 THE GAZETTE OF INDIA : EXTRAORDINARY [PART II—SEC. 3(ii)] MINISTRY OF LABOUR AND EMPLOYMENT NOTIFICATION New Delhi, the 13th May, 2026 S.O. 2492(E).— In exercise of the powers conferred by clause (f) of sub -section (1) of section 2 of the Code on Occupational Safety, Health and Working Conditions, 2020 (37 of 2020), the Central Government hereby notifies Rupees Ninteen thousand per month as the amount of remuneration for the purposes of the said clause or where such remuneration is by way of lump sum, an amount equivalent thereto. [F. No. S-65025/2/2026-ISH-II] ALOK CHANDRA, Senior Labour and Employment Advisor Uploaded by Dte. of Printing at Government of India Press, Ring Road, Mayapuri, New Delhi-110064 and Published by the Controller of Publications, Delhi-110054.",
