    "text": ".-16052026-272592 CG-DL-E-16052026-272592 2 THE GAZETTE OF INDIA : EXTRAORDINARY [PART II—SEC. 3(ii)] सारणी क्र.सं. अजधकारी का पिनाम अजधकाररता (क्षेत्र) (1) (2) (3) 1. मिाजनिेिक कारखाना सलाि सेिा एिं श्रम संस्ट्थान मिाजनिेिालय, मुंबई। सभी प्रमुख पत्तन। 2 उप मिाजनिेिक कारखाना सलाि सेिा एिं श्रम संस्ट्थान मिाजनिेिालय, मुंबई। सभी प्रमुख पत्तन। [फा. सं. एस-65025/23/2026-आईएसएच-II] आलोक चंर, िररष्ठ श्रम और रोिगार सलािकार MINISTRY OF LABOUR AND EMPLOYMENT NOTIFICATION New Delhi, the 13th May, 2026 S.O. 24 82(E).— In exercise of the powers conferred by sub -section (1) of section 114 of the Occupational Safety, Health and Working Conditions Code, 2020 (37 of 2020), the Central Government hereby appoints the officers mentioned in column (2) of the table below to be th e officer in the corresponding entry for composition of offences for the purposes of the said code, in case of dock work, for the areas specified in column (3) of the Table below: TABLE Sl.No. Designation of officers Jurisdiction",
