    "text": "म संस्ट्थान मिाजनिेिालय, मुंबई। सभी प्रमुख पत्तन। [फा.सं. एस-65025/13/2026-आईएसएच-II] आलोक चंद्र, वररष्ठ श्रम और रोिगार सलािकार सं. 2394] नई दिल्ली, बुधवार, मई 13, 2026/वैिाख 23, 1948 No. 2394] NEW DELHI, WEDNESDAY, MAY 13, 2026/VAISAKHA 23, 1948 सी.जी.-डी.एल.-अ.-19052026-272684 CG-DL-E-19052026-272684 2 THE GAZETTE OF INDIA : EXTRAORDINARY [PART II—SEC. 3(ii)] MINISTRY OF LABOUR AND EMPLOYMENT NOTIFICATION New Delhi, the 13th May, 2026 S.O. 2486(E).—In exercise of the power conferred by sub -section (1) of section 111 of the Occupational Safety, Health and Working Conditions Code, 2020 (37 of 2020), the Central Government hereby appoints the officer mentioned in column (2) of the table below to be the officer to impose penalty under the provision of the said Code, in case of dock work, within the local limits of the jurisdiction specified in column (3) of the Table below: - TABLE Sl. No. Designation of Officer Limits of ports (1) (2) (3) 1. Deputy Director (Safety), Dock Safety Divisi",
