    "text": "XTRAORDINARY [PART II—SEC. 3(ii)] 11. Deputy Director General of Mines Safety, Director of Mines Safety (Mechanical), Director of Mines Safety (Electrical) of Northern Zone. Northern Zone having jurisdiction in the States of Uttar Pradesh, Haryana, Uttarakhand, Himachal Pradesh, Punjab, Madhya Pradesh and Union territories of Delhi, Chandigarh, Jammu and Kashmir and Ladakh with headquarters at Ghaziabad (Uttar Pradesh), comprising of Ghaziabad Region, Srinagar Region, Parasia Region, Jabalpur Region, Gwalior Region and Varanasi Region. 12. Director of Mines Safety, Dhanbad Region-1. Parts of the Jharkhand State: All the mines in the District of Dhanbad lying on the West of Giridih- Tundi-Govindpur Road and North of NH- 32 from Govindpur - Dhanbad to Bokaro. 13. Director of Mines Safety, Dhanbad Region-2, Parts of the Jharkhand State: All the mines in the District of Dhanbad lying on the East of Giridih- Tundi- Govindpur Road and South of NH-32 from Govindpur- Dhanbad to Bokaro. 14. Dir",
